    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2016342391",
      "Source": "Remove the AATMenu button from the inventory.\\n\\nDoes not make the AATMenu admin-only! Can still be opened with custom keybinds or the following command:\\n\\ncheat scriptcommand aat aatmenu\\n\\n\\nOff: A AATMenu button will appear in your inventory.\\n\\nOn: No button will appear in your inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这不会使AAT菜单仅管理员可用！仍可通过自定义键位绑定或以下命令打开：\\n\\ncheat scriptcommand aat aatmenu\\n\\n\\n关闭：物品栏中将显示AAT菜单按钮。\\n\\n开启：物品栏中不会显示按钮。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
