    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::463228875",
      "Source": "Should non admins be able to see other tribes?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可查看其他部落？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2858103023",
      "Source": "Should non admins be able to see the coords of players and tribe structures?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可查看玩家及部落建筑的坐标？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3775341518",
      "Source": "Allow non admins to open the Ark Dashboard?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"是否允许非管理员打开 “方舟仪表盘”？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1710430808",
      "Source": "Allowing non admins to access the Ark Dashboard will not allow them to access admin commands like item spawning or player killing. It would only allow them to see pure cosmetic features players and structures. (Unless you changed some configuration on the previous panel.)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"允许非管理员访问 “方舟仪表盘”，并不意味着他们能使用物品生成、玩家击杀等管理员指令。他们仅能查看与玩家和建筑相关的纯外观类信息（除非你在之前的面板中修改过部分配置）。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::848878709",
      "Source": "Should non admins be able to see an overview of all players?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可查看所有玩家的概览？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3531844248",
      "Source": "Should non admins be able to see an overview of all tamed dinos?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可查看所有已驯服恐龙的概览？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3688990513",
      "Source": "Should non admins be able to see an overview of all structures?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可查看所有建筑的概览？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3199915598",
      "Source": "Should non admins be able to see an overview of all wild dinos?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可查看所有野生恐龙的概览？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2382994863",
      "Source": "You can add some buffs like ghost, fly, hide,... , to yourself by using the QUICK BUFFS button in your inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通过使用背包中的 “快速增益”（QUICK BUFFS）按钮，你可为自己添加幽灵模式（ghost）、飞行（fly）、隐身（hide）等增益效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3498073296",
      "Source": "Complete",
      "Trans": {"SC":"配置完成","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3052000847",
      "Source": "You don't want your admins to change your mod configuration?\\n\\n\\nUse INI to override mod configuration.\\n\\n\\nConfiguration overwritten in the INI can no longer be changed in the configuration tab in-game.\\n\\nThis means that your admins will no longer be able to change the configuration here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你不希望管理员修改你的模组配置？\\n\\n\\n 请使用 INI 文件覆盖模组配置。\\n\\n\\n 在 INI 文件中覆盖的配置，将无法在游戏内的 “配置” 标签页中修改。\\n\\n 这意味着管理员将无法在此处修改相关配置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::908835097",
      "Source": "Just copy any configuration you would like to override and the section from the right side to the GameUserSettings.ini and restart the server.\\n\\n\\nThe values in the right side are the currently used values.\\n\\n\\nPM = Player Overview\\nTM = Structure Overview\\nDM = Tamed Dino Overview\\nWDM = Wild Dino Overview\\nAT = Admin Tool\\nOL = Object Locator\\nMC = Mass Destroy",
      "Trans": {"SC":"只需将你想要覆盖的任意配置及其对应分区，从右侧复制到 GameUserSettings.ini 文件中，然后重启服务器即可。\\n\\n\\n 右侧显示的数值为当前正在使用的数值。\\n\\n\\nPM = 玩家概览 \\nTM = 建筑概览 \\nDM = 已驯服恐龙概览 \\nWDM = 野生恐龙概览 \\nAT = 管理员工具 \\nOL = 对象定位器 \\nMC = 批量销毁","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3034231545",
      "Source": "Remove the Admin Tool icon from the inventory.\\n\\nCan still be spawned with the following command:\\n\\ncheat gfi admintool 1 0 0\\n\\n\\nOff: An Admin Tool button will appear in your inventory.\\n\\nOn: No button will appear in your inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从背包中移除 “管理员工具” 图标。\\n\\n 仍可通过以下指令生成该工具：\\n\\ncheat gfi admintool 1 0 0\\n\\n\\n 关闭（Off）：背包中会显示 “管理员工具” 按钮。\\n\\n 开启（On）：背包中不会显示 “管理员工具” 按钮。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2918342903",
      "Source": "Changes the location of the Admin Tool button.\\n\\n\\nX=0.0 Y=-415,0: The Admin Tool button will appear at the bottom of your inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修改 “管理员工具” 按钮的位置。\\n\\n\\nX=0.0、Y=-415.0：“管理员工具” 按钮将显示在背包底部。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4119415731",
      "Source": "Changes the location of the AATMenu button.\\n\\nPresets can be found in the onboarding panel.\\n\\n\\nX=-778,0 Y=527,0: The AATMenu button will appear at the top left corner of the inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修改 “AAT 菜单”按钮的位置。\\n\\n 预设位置可在初始设置面板中找到。\\n\\n\\nX=-778.0、Y=527.0：“AAT 菜单” 按钮将显示在背包左上角。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::446251449",
      "Source": "Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2446256167",
      "Source": "Add To Radial Menu",
      "Trans": {"SC":"添加到环形菜单","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3535955350",
      "Source": "Non Admin Object Type Blacklist",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员对象类型黑名单","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::387162640",
      "Source": "Current blacklist:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当前黑名单：","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2855511375",
      "Source": "Should non-admins be able to use the Object Locator?\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can use the Object Locator.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can use the Object Locator.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员是否可使用 “对象定位器”（Object Locator）？\\n\\n\\n 关闭（Off）：所有人均可使用 “对象定位器”。\\n\\n 开启（On）：仅管理员可使用 “对象定位器”。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4204050845",
      "Source": "Add the Object Locator button to the radial wheel (Hold Reload).\\n\\n\\nOff: No button will get added to the radial wheel.\\n\\nOn: An Object Locator button will appear in the radial wheel (Awesome ARK Tools > Object Locator).",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将 “对象定位器” 按钮添加到环形轮盘（按住 “换弹键” 调出）。\\n\\n\\n 关闭（Off）：环形轮盘中不会添加该按钮。\\n\\n 开启（On）：环形轮盘中将显示 “对象定位器” 按钮（位于 “A方舟工具”（Awesome ARK Tools）>“对象定位器” 菜单下）。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4232000920",
      "Source": "Prevent non-admins from scanning the blacklisted types.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"禁止非管理员扫描黑名单中的对象类型。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2342821179",
      "Source": "Tool Range",
      "Trans": {"SC":"工具范围","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4198100073",
      "Source": "How far can the admin tool hit objects in UE units.\\n\\n\\n10000: The admin tool can hit objects up to a distance 33.3 foundations.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"“管理员工具” 可击中对象的最远距离（以 UE 单位计）。\\n\\n\\n10000（UE 单位）：“管理员工具” 可击中最远 33.3 个地基距离外的对象。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3800535729",
      "Source": "Allow Unreleased Dinos",
      "Trans": {"SC":"允许生成未发布恐龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4195019199",
      "Source": "Will allow players to spawn unreleased dinos (Genesis/Genesis 2) from the Spawn Dino tab.)\\n\\nUnreleased dinos have not been updated to the ascended version of the game. Spawning them can cause crashes or other issues.\\nUse at your own risk.\\n\\n\\nOff: Creatures from Genesis 1/2 will not appear in any spawn dino list.\\n\\nOn: Creatures from Genesis 1/2 will appear in all spawn dino lists.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"允许玩家从 “生成恐龙”（Spawn Dino）标签页中生成未发布的恐龙（源自《创世纪 1》/《创世纪 2》）。\\n\\n 未发布的恐龙尚未更新至游戏的 “飞升版”，生成此类恐龙可能导致游戏崩溃或出现其他问题。请自行承担风险。\\n\\n\\n 关闭（Off）：《创世纪 1》/《创世纪 2》中的恐龙不会出现在任何 “生成恐龙” 列表中。\\n\\n 开启（On）：《创世纪 1》/《创世纪 2》中的恐龙将出现在所有 “生成恐龙” 列表中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3437973384",
      "Source": "Add this Discord bot to your Discord server to unlock even more features like:\\n* Cross-server chatting\\n* Discord to ARK chatting\\n* Sending commands to ARK from DiscordAdd this Discord bot to your Discord server to unlock even more features like:\\n* Cross-server chatting\\n* Discord to ARK chatting\\n* Sending commands to ARK from Discord",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将此 Discord 机器人添加到你的 Discord 服务器，即可解锁更多功能，例如：\\n* 跨服务器聊天 \\n* 从 Discord 发送消息到方舟（ARK）游戏内 \\n* 从 Discord 向方舟（ARK）发送指令","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
