    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::631419548",
      "Source": "Should be enabled if you want to connect your ARK server to your Discord server and the bot to work for you.\\nWill automatically disable if no Discord server is connected to this ARK server after one hour.\\n\\n\\nOff: This server will not connect to the Awesome ARK Tools Discord bot.\\n\\nOn: This server will connect to the Awesome ARK Tools Discord bot and can connect to your Discord server.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"若你希望将方舟服务器与 Discord 服务器连接，并正常使用该机器人，请启用此功能。\\n 若 1 小时后仍未将此方舟服务器与任何 Discord 服务器连接，该功能将自动关闭。\\n\\n\\n 关闭（Off）：此服务器不会与 “A方舟工具”（Awesome ARK Tools）的 Discord 机器人连接。\\n\\n 开启（On）：此服务器将与 “超级方舟工具” 的 Discord 机器人连接，并可关联到你的 Discord 服务器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1012105717",
      "Source": "Configuration is saved on the server (Saved/SaveGames/AwesomeAdminTools/ModConfiguration.sav) and can be copied to other servers or as backup. Requires reboot after copying.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"配置文件保存在服务器中（路径：Saved/SaveGames/AwesomeAdminTools/ModConfiguration.sav），可复制到其他服务器或用作备份。复制后需重启服务器方可生效。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::513328097",
      "Source": "Server Invite Link",
      "Trans": {"SC":"服务器邀请链接","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2476218115",
      "Source": "Reports Channel Webhook",
      "Trans": {"SC":"举报频道网络钩子","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3208210708",
      "Source": "Admin Logging Webhook",
      "Trans": {"SC":"管理员日志网络钩子","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1724438446",
      "Source": "A discord button will appear at the bottom of this menu.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此菜单底部将显示一个 “Discord” 按钮。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2818061327",
      "Source": "All reports from the 'Report A Bug' panel will be sent to this webhook.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"“举报漏洞”面板中的所有举报信息，都将发送到此网络钩子对应的频道。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::926452468",
      "Source": "All logs about admin stuff will get sent to this webhook.\\nLogs include item spawning, dino spawning, base destroying, ...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"所有与管理员操作相关的日志，都将发送到此网络钩子对应的频道。\\n 日志包含物品生成、恐龙生成、基地销毁等内容...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1844889465",
      "Source": "Enable Debug Logging",
      "Trans": {"SC":"启用调试日志","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::111211170",
      "Source": "Max Replication Count",
      "Trans": {"SC":"最大同步数量","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::29515065",
      "Source": "Tracking Update Speed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"追踪更新速度","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3530252330",
      "Source": "Cryopod Item",
      "Trans": {"SC":"低温舱物品","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3812987256",
      "Source": "Class",
      "Trans": {"SC":"类别","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2395014878",
      "Source": "Logs some extra data to the logs for debugging. Might make some things load slower.\\n\\nDo not enable this if you want optimal performance.\\n\\n\\nOff: Do not log the debug logs.\\n\\nOn: Log everything.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在日志中记录额外的调试数据，可能会导致部分内容加载变慢。\\n\\n 若追求最佳性能，请不要启用此功能。\\n\\n\\n 关闭（Off）：不记录调试日志。\\n\\n 开启（On）：记录所有内容的调试日志。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2544387364",
      "Source": "Changes how fast data goes from server to client. Impacts how many structures get moved every frame in possess/paste mode.\\n\\nPutting this number too high can cause data replication to fail so clients would need to rerender this area.\\n\\n\\n25: Every frame replicates 25 structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修改数据从服务器传输到客户端的速度，影响 “控制 / 粘贴”（possess/paste）模式下每帧移动的建筑数量。\\n\\n 此数值设置过高可能导致数据同步失败，客户端需重新渲染该区域。\\n\\n\\n25：每帧同步 25 个建筑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1765398907",
      "Source": "Changes how fast to update tracking markers.\\n\\nPutting this number too low can impact server performance.\\n\\nThis number is the time between marker location updates.\\n\\n\\nIf tracking three dinos. Example of timestamps if set to 0.5:\\n0.0 second: Tracking enabled.\\n0.5 second: Update dino n1.\\n1.0 second: Update dino n2.\\n1.5 second: Update dino n3.\\n2.0 second: Update dino n1.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修改追踪标记的更新速度。\\n\\n 此数值设置过低可能影响服务器性能。\\n\\n 该数值代表追踪标记位置更新的时间间隔。\\n\\n\\n 若追踪 3 只恐龙，且此数值设为 0.5（秒），则时间戳示例如下：\\n0.0 秒：启用追踪功能。\\n0.5 秒：更新第 1 只恐龙的位置。\\n1.0 秒：更新第 2 只恐龙的位置。\\n1.5 秒：更新第 3 只恐龙的位置。\\n2.0 秒：再次更新第 1 只恐龙的位置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2413004993",
      "Source": "Change what this mod should use as cryopods for dinos.\\n\\nFor custom cryopods, find the cryopod class in the Spawn Items tab and paste it here.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"修改该模组用于存放恐龙的低温舱类型。\\n\\n 若需使用自定义低温舱，请在 “生成物品”标签页中找到该低温舱的类别，并粘贴到此处。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
