    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3234858918",
      "Source": "Hide the whole admin menu from non-admins including the AATMenu button.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can open the AATMenu.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can open the AATMenu.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对非管理员隐藏整个管理菜单（包括 AAT菜单 按钮）。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可打开 AATMenu。\\n\\n 开启：仅管理员可打开 AAT菜单。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2673816702",
      "Source": "Non-admins will only be able to see their own player, tribe and tamed dinos.\\n\\n\\nOff: Non-admins can see other players, tribes and dinos.\\n\\nOn: Non-admins can only see their own tribe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"非管理员仅能查看自身、所属部落及已驯服的恐龙。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：非管理员可查看其他玩家、部落及恐龙。\\n\\n 开启：非管理员仅能查看自身所属部落。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3554760324",
      "Source": "Gives tribe owners the ability to destroy their own structures and dinos using the Admin Menu in Structure/Tamed dinos overview tab. In other words: Gives tribe owners admin powers over their own tribe.\\n\\n\\nOff: Tribe owners can not destroy their own tribe.\\n\\nOn: Tribe owners can destroy their own structures and dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"赋予部落所有者通过 “建筑 / 已驯服恐龙概览” 标签页中的管理菜单，销毁自身部落建筑及恐龙的权限。换言之：赋予部落所有者对自身部落的管理员权限。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：部落所有者无法销毁自身部落。\\n\\n 开启：部落所有者可销毁自身部落的建筑及恐龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1186304897",
      "Source": "Coords of players, tribes and tamed dinos will only be visible to admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see coords of players, tribes and tamed dinos.\\n\\nOn: Non-admins can not see coords of players, tribes and tamed dinos. They will also not be able to use the tracking system for these type of actors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"玩家、部落及已驯服恐龙的坐标仅对管理员可见。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看玩家、部落及已驯服恐龙的坐标。\\n\\n 开启：非管理员无法查看玩家、部落及已驯服恐龙的坐标，也无法使用针对这些对象的追踪系统。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::987969531",
      "Source": "Coords of wild dinos will only be visible to admins. \\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see coords of wild dinos.\\n\\nOn: Non-admins can not see coords of wild dinos. They will also not be able to use the tracking system for wild dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"野生恐龙的坐标仅对管理员可见。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看野生恐龙的坐标。\\n\\n 开启：非管理员无法查看野生恐龙的坐标，也无法使用针对野生恐龙的追踪系统。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2363111548",
      "Source": "The smaller this number, the faster large amounts of structures get destroyed like a whole base.\\n\\nIf too low, the server could crash.\\n\\n\\n0.005: Destroy structures twice as fast.\\n\\n0.02:Destroying structures takes double the time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此数值越小，大量建筑（如整个基地）的销毁速度越快。\\n\\n 数值过低可能导致服务器崩溃。\\n\\n\\n0.005：建筑销毁速度翻倍。\\n\\n0.02：建筑销毁速度减半。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::748998882",
      "Source": "Player Overview Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"玩家概览仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2668039748",
      "Source": "Hide the players tab from non-admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the players tab.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the players tab.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对非管理员隐藏 “玩家” 标签页。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看 “玩家” 标签页。\\n\\n 开启：仅管理员可查看 “玩家” 标签页。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::253883464",
      "Source": "Structure Overview Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑概览仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::277343333",
      "Source": "Base Range",
      "Trans": {"SC":"基地范围","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3907929093",
      "Source": "Structure Data Update Speed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑数据更新速度","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1626178461",
      "Source": "Minutes Between Structure Data Updates",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑数据更新间隔（分钟）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3526362907",
      "Source": "Disable Destroy Code",
      "Trans": {"SC":"禁用销毁验证码","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3724345743",
      "Source": "Hide the structures tab from non-admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the structures tab.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the structures tab.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对非管理员隐藏 “建筑” 标签页。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看 “建筑” 标签页。\\n\\n 开启：仅管理员可查看 “建筑” 标签页。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1460881260",
      "Source": "How far away from eachother should structures be considered a base in UE units.\\n\\n\\n15000: Structures within a range of 30 foundations are considered one base.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"以 UE 单位计算，建筑间距离达到多少时可判定为同一基地。\\n\\n\\n15000（UE 单位）：30 个地基范围内的建筑判定为同一基地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1197096946",
      "Source": "The smaller this number, the faster an update of all structure data will be.\\n\\nIf too low, the server could lag.\\n\\n\\n0.0125: Updates go twice as fast.\\n\\n0.05: Updates go half as fast.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此数值越小，所有建筑数据的更新速度越快。\\n\\n 数值过低可能导致服务器延迟。\\n\\n\\n0.0125：更新速度翻倍。\\n\\n0.05：更新速度减半。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::22741587",
      "Source": "How long should it take for bases to update again after the last update.\\n\\n\\n20: Automatically update every 20 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"上次更新后，基地再次更新需间隔多长时间。\\n\\n\\n20（分钟）：每 20 分钟自动更新一次。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1747315071",
      "Source": "When destroying bases, you will not need to type a code anymore.\\n\\n\\nOff: Destroying a base requires you to type a simple code.\\n\\nOn: Destroying a base requires you to press a single button.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"销毁基地时，无需再输入验证码。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：销毁基地需输入简单验证码。\\n\\n 开启：销毁基地仅需点击一个按钮。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1705700229",
      "Source": "Tamed Dino Overview Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"已驯服恐龙概览仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3611267778",
      "Source": "Dino Data Update Speed",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恐龙数据更新速度","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3507988394",
      "Source": "Minutes Between Dino Data Updates",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恐龙数据更新间隔（分钟）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::115575030",
      "Source": "Dino Stats Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恐龙属性仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2443206766",
      "Source": "Hide the tamed dinos tab from non-admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the tamed dinos tab.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the tamed dinos tab.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对非管理员隐藏 “已驯服恐龙” 标签页。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看 “已驯服恐龙” 标签页。\\n\\n 开启：仅管理员可查看 “已驯服恐龙” 标签页。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2684895293",
      "Source": "The smaller this number, the faster a update of all dino data will be.\\n\\nIf too low, the server could lag.\\n\\n\\n0.005: Updates go twice as fast.\\n\\n0.02: Update go half as fast.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此数值越小，所有恐龙数据的更新速度越快。\\n\\n 数值过低可能导致服务器延迟。\\n\\n\\n0.005：更新速度翻倍。\\n\\n0.02：更新速度减半。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3905846148",
      "Source": "How long should it take for dinos to update again after the last update.\\n\\n\\n10: Automatically update every 10 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"上次更新后，恐龙数据再次更新需间隔多长时间。\\n\\n\\n10（分钟）：每 10 分钟自动更新一次。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1542931475",
      "Source": "Should the stats of the dinos be hidden for non admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the stats and traits of tamed and wild dinos.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the stats and traits of tamed and wild dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"是否对非管理员隐藏恐龙的属性。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看已驯服恐龙及野生恐龙的属性与特性。\\n\\n 开启：仅管理员可查看已驯服恐龙及野生恐龙的属性与特性。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1638449993",
      "Source": "Wild Dino Overview Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"野生恐龙概览仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3085897777",
      "Source": "Hide the wild dinos tab from non-admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the wild dinos tab.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the wild dinos tab.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"对非管理员隐藏 “野生恐龙” 标签页。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有人均可查看 “野生恐龙” 标签页。\\n\\n 开启：仅管理员可查看 “野生恐龙” 标签页。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3740688973",
      "Source": "These configurations can only be changed in the GameUserSettings.ini of the server",
      "Trans": {"SC":"以下配置仅可在服务器的 GameUserSettings.ini 文件中修改","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1778473192",
      "Source": "Click 'INI overrides' button for a better overview of the INI",
      "Trans": {"SC":"点击 “INI 覆盖” 按钮，可更清晰地查看 INI 文件内容","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2911422165",
      "Source": "Admin Whitelist",
      "Trans": {"SC":"管理员白名单","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4039016709",
      "Source": "Admin Access Requires Whitelist",
      "Trans": {"SC":"管理员权限需通过白名单验证","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2661564123",
      "Source": "A comma-seperated list of EosIDs of players.\\nAll players in this list can access the AATMenu in admin mode without having to log in as admin.\\n\\nNon-admins can also be given admin access to the menu in admin mode this way.\\n\\n\\n[AwesomeAdminTools]\\nAdminWhitelist=w8u7gb1s9gtggks5g1s, w7g8bs55h7d1fbd, e7g9b1s7f9gv1",
      "Trans": {"SC":"以逗号分隔的玩家 EosID 列表。\\n 列表中的所有玩家无需以管理员身份登录，即可在管理员模式下访问 AAT菜单。\\n\\n 也可通过此方式为非管理员赋予管理员模式下的菜单访问权限。\\n\\n\\n [AwesomeAdminTools]\\nAdminWhitelist=w8u7gb1s9gtggks5g1s, w7g8bs55h7d1fbd, e7g9b1s7f9gv1","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::964205109",
      "Source": "Only players in the 'Admin Whitelist' will be able to access the AATMenu in admin mode.\\n\\n\\nOff: All admins and all players in the 'Admin Whitelist' can access the AATMenu in admin mode.\\n\\nOn: Only the players in the 'Admin Whitelist' can access the AATMenu in admin mode.\\n\\n\\n[AwesomeAdminTools]\\nAdminWhitelistRequired=false",
      "Trans": {"SC":"仅 “管理员白名单” 中的玩家可在管理员模式下访问 AAT菜单。\\n\\n\\n 关闭：所有管理员及 “管理员白名单” 中的所有玩家，均可在管理员模式下访问 AAT菜单。\\n\\n 开启：仅 “管理员白名单” 中的玩家可在管理员模式下访问 AAT菜单。\\n\\n\\n [AwesomeAdminTools]\\nAdminWhitelistRequired=false","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
