    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2675359608",
      "Source": "Report A Bug In Awesome Admin Tools",
      "Trans": {"SC":"举报A管理员工具中的漏洞","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2112553849",
      "Source": "Found an issue or think something could be better about the mod?\\nTell me by typing it in the box below and pressing the send report button.\\nPlease properly explain the problem, I can not do anything with 'menu does not work' or 'mod is broken'.\\nIf you want a response, you should join the Awesome Admin Tools discord server.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"发现漏洞，或认为该模组有可改进之处？\\n 在下方输入框中详细描述，并点击 “发送举报” 按钮告知我们。\\n 请清晰说明问题，仅说 “菜单用不了” 或 “模组坏了” 无法帮助我们解决问题。\\n 若希望获得回复，请加入A管理员工具的 Discord 服务器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4165413756",
      "Source": "Where does this bug happen?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该漏洞发生在何处？","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
