      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3291161649",
      "Source": "Hides the AATMenu button from the inventory.\\n\\nTHIS DOES NOT MAKE IT ADMIN ONLY\\n\\nSet all individual tabs to admin only for actual admin only.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everone can see the AATMenu button in the inventory.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the AATMenu button in the inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从库存中隐藏AAT菜单按钮。<#N#><#N#>这并不会使其仅限管理员使用<#N#><#N#>将所有单独的选项卡设置为仅限管理员，以实现真正的仅限管理员。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都可以在库存中看到AAT菜单按钮。<#N#><#N#>开启：只有管理员可以在库存中看到AAT菜单按钮。","JA":""},
