      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3586280498",
      "Source": "Changes the position of the Welcome Panel in the Pause Menu.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"更改暂停菜单中欢迎面板的位置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3605981011",
      "Source": "Changes the size of the Welcome Panel in the Pause Menu.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"更改暂停菜单中欢迎面板的大小。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1745758710",
      "Source": "Prevent Cheat Fly",
      "Trans": {"SC":"防止作弊飞行","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1969556983",
      "Source": "Prevents non-admins from cheat-flying (cheat fly).\\nFixes the issue where players sometimes start to fly without reason.\\nLogs to server-log with the following message: \"[AAT] Prevented <PlayerName> from cheat-flying.\"\\n\\n\\nOn: non-admins won't be able to receive any cheat-fly buffs.\\n\\nOff: non-admins can receive cheat-fly buffs.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"阻止非管理员玩家进行作弊飞行（cheat fly）。<#N#>修复玩家有时无故开始飞行的问题。<#N#>在服务器日志中记录以下信息：\"[AAT] 已阻止 <PlayerName> 进行作弊飞行。\"<#N#><#N#><#N#>开启：非管理员玩家将无法获得任何作弊飞行增益。<#N#><#N#>关闭：非管理员玩家可以获得作弊飞行增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2341908743",
      "Source": "AATMenu - General",
      "Trans": {"SC":"AAT菜单-通用","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1458691676",
      "Source": "Gives tribe owners the ability to destroy their own structures and dinos using the AATMenu in Tribes overview tab. In other words: Gives tribe owners admin powers over their own tribe.\\n\\n\\nOff: Tribe owners can not destroy their own tribe.\\n\\nOn: Tribe owners can destroy their own tribe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"赋予部落长在部落概览选项卡中使用AAT菜单摧毁自己部落建筑和恐龙的能力。换句话说：赋予部落长对自己部落的管理员权限。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：部落长不能摧毁自己的部落。<#N#><#N#>开启：部落长可以摧毁自己的部落。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::405267726",
      "Source": "Tribe Owner Can Cryo Own Tribe",
      "Trans": {"SC":"部落长可冷冻自己部落","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3250768724",
      "Source": "Gives tribe owners the ability to cryo their own dinos using the AATMenu in Structure/Tamed dinos overview tab. In other words: Gives tribe owners admin powers over their own tribe.\\n\\n\\nOff: Tribe owners can not cryo their own dinos.\\n\\nOn: Tribe owners can cryo their own dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"赋予部落长在建筑/已驯服恐龙概览选项卡中使用 AAT菜单 冷冻自己恐龙的能力。换句话说：赋予部落长对自己部落的管理员权限。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：部落长不能冷冻自己的恐龙。<#N#><#N#>开启：部落长可以冷冻自己的恐龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2385645577",
      "Source": "Hide Advanced Configuration",
      "Trans": {"SC":"隐藏高级配置","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::968110593",
      "Source": "Show Advanced Configuration",
      "Trans": {"SC":"显示高级配置","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2025595416",
      "Source": "AATMenu - Players",
      "Trans": {"SC":"AAT菜单 - 玩家","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4287440747",
      "Source": "Coords of players will only be visible to admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see coords of players.\\n\\nOn: Non-admins can not see coords of players. They will also not be able to use the tracking system for these type of actors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"玩家的坐标将仅对管理员可见。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到玩家的坐标。<#N#><#N#>开启：非管理员无法看到玩家的坐标。他们也将无法对这些类型的角色使用追踪系统。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3956756755",
      "Source": "AATMenu - Tribes",
      "Trans": {"SC":"AAT菜单 - 部落","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3631759062",
      "Source": "Hide the tribes tab from non-admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the tribes tab.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the tribes tab.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"隐藏部落标签页，使其对非管理员不可见。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到部落标签页。<#N#><#N#>开启：仅管理员能看到部落标签页。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2171660123",
      "Source": "Coords of tribe bases and dinos will only be visible to admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see coords of tribe bases and dinos.\\n\\nOn: Non-admins can not see coords of tribe bases and dinos. They will also not be able to use the tracking system for these type of actors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"部落基地和恐龙的坐标将仅对管理员可见。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到部落基地和恐龙的坐标。<#N#><#N#>开启：非管理员无法看到部落基地和恐龙的坐标。他们也将无法对这些类型的角色使用追踪系统。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1176232998",
      "Source": "AATMenu - Wild Dinos",
      "Trans": {"SC":"AAT菜单 - 野生恐龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1104362345",
      "Source": "Tab Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"标签页仅管理员可见","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3943412169",
      "Source": "Coords Admin Only",
      "Trans": {"SC":"坐标仅管理员可见","JA":""},
