      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1576222835",
      "Source": "Should the stats of the dinos be hidden for non admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the stats of wild dinos.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the stat of wild dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"是否对非管理员隐藏恐龙的属性。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到野生恐龙的属性。<#N#><#N#>开启：仅管理员能看到野生恐龙的属性。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3551685569",
      "Source": "Should the traits of the dinos be hidden for non admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the traits of tamed and wild dinos.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the traits of tamed and wild dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"是否对非管理员隐藏恐龙的特性。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到已驯服和野生恐龙的特性。<#N#><#N#>开启：仅管理员能看到已驯服和野生恐龙的特性。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2323662447",
      "Source": "Should the quality of traits of the dinos be hidden for non admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the quality of traits of tamed and wild dinos.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the quality of traits of tamed and wild dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"是否对非管理员隐藏恐龙特性的品质。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到已驯服和野生恐龙特性的品质。<#N#><#N#>开启：仅管理员能看到已驯服和野生恐龙特性的品质。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::717914559",
      "Source": "Should the level of dinos be hidden for non admins.\\n\\n\\nOff: Everyone can see the level of wild dinos.\\n\\nOn: Only admins can see the level of wild dinos.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"是否对非管理员隐藏恐龙的等级。<#N#><#N#><#N#>关闭：所有人都能看到野生恐龙的等级。<#N#><#N#>开启：仅管理员能看到野生恐龙的等级。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2905818490",
      "Source": "Adds a random offset to the location of dinos in the Wild Dinos tab.\\n\\n\\n3000: Adds a random offset of 10 foundations in every direction which means the selected dino could be anywhere in an area of 20 by 20 foundations.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"为野生恐龙标签页中的恐龙位置添加随机偏移。<#N#><#N#><#N#>3000：在每个方向上添加10个地基的随机偏移，这意味着所选恐龙可能出现在20x20地基区域内的任何位置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
