    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3499043209",
      "Source": "The image on the right represents two zones where the \"No Fly\" setting is enabled.\\n\\nThe SubSetting \"Dismount In Zone\" is enabled in the green zone (priority = 0) but disabled in the blue zone (priority = 1).\\n\\n- If you are situated in one zone, you will use that zone his sub settings.\\n\\n- If you are situated in two zones (red area), you will use the sub settings of the zone with the highest priority.\\n\\nIn this example if you are situated in the:\\n\\nblue zone -> \"Dismount In Zone\" = disabled \\n\\ngreen zone -> \"Dismount In Zone\" = enabled\\n\\nred area  -> \"Dismount In Zone\" = disabled",
      "Trans": {"SC":"右侧图像表示启用了“禁止飞行”设置的两个区域。<#N#><#N#>“区域内下马”子设置在绿色区域（优先级=0）中启用，但在蓝色区域（优先级=1）中禁用。<#N#><#N#>- 如果您位于一个区域内，将使用该区域的子设置。<#N#><#N#>- 如果您位于两个区域（红色区域），将使用优先级最高的区域的子设置。<#N#><#N#>在此示例中，如果您位于：<#N#><#N#>蓝色区域 -> “区域内下马” = 禁用 <#N#><#N#>绿色区域 -> “区域内下马” = 启用<#N#><#N#>红色区域 -> “区域内下马” = 禁用","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
